This should be a complete and working chess bot. It uses:
1. Minimax with alpha-beta pruning at depth 3
2. Piece-square tables for positional evaluation
3. Move ordering by capture value for better pruning
4. Check for mate in 1
5. Fallback handling for edge cases

The bot should be competitive and always return a legal move.
